Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Gate cloud separator acceleration and cost profile

Reason: Cloud workers opt into Linux AOTI, batch-aware caches, shared model
leases, extended timings, and explicit cost/quality sample rates. Local keeps
the upstream separator arguments and cache behavior.
Removal: Delete after upstream exposes equivalent separator policy controls.

